        "description": "Solid narrow oscillation: five positive crests (two left of the origin, one at it, two right) and four intervening negative troughs. The left edge enters upward into the first crest, and the right edge descends from the last crest toward the x-axis. No endpoint dots or assigned endpoints. Formula y=cos20x at upper right. Quantitative provenance: Edition Example2 supplies y=cos20x and horizontal multiplier 1/20. Exact extrema, zeros and period may be calculated from that function; they are not measured scan coordinates. Exact finite display cuts and original O/0 glyph remain UNKNOWN; modern O are declared editorial naming additions. Curve coordinates are calculated from approved edition functions, not measured from pixels.",
